Artificial Intelligence:
- Google Gemini API.
- Use the currently supported Gemini model available in the environment.
- Keep model configuration centralised so it can be changed without rewriting the application.

Other requirements:
- Progressive Web App (PWA).
- Mobile-first responsive interface.
